<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξιό-λογος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worthy of mention,
				remarkable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐν Ἐφέσῳ νηός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.148
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος -ώτατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο -ώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.2.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλίθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.5.5
				</span></i>
			, Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.128e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>of note, important,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μάλιστα ἐν τέλει καὶ
					ἀξιολογωτάτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μιμήματα</span> imitations of
				<i>worthy</i> objects, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				669e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
